<body>
  <h1>AI Job Seeker</h1>

  <p>
    AI Job Seeker is a personal automation tool designed to help
    identify relevant job opportunities and prepare job applications.
  </p>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>
    The application collects publicly available job listings, evaluates
    their relevance to the user's preferences, and can prepare application
    emails with supporting documents.
  </p>
  <p>
    Email applications are sent through the user's Gmail account only
    when the configured application rules allow them.
  </p>

  <h2>Data and privacy</h2>
  <p>
    The application runs on the user's own computer. Job data,
    configuration, CV files, and OAuth credentials are stored locally
    according to the user's local setup.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a href="/privacy.html">Read our Privacy Policy</a>
  </p>
</body>
